 six-month extension requires paying at least 90% of the tax and filing CB
 T-200-T.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/form-1120s-s-corp-guid
 e/\nGeneral information\, not tax advice. Merchant Financial Advisory\, m
